<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6483] Entries count in caches&apos; MX Beans not immediately available</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6483</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When querying properties like&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;cache.mxBean().getOffHeapPrimaryEntriesCount()
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The value is often 0 (zero) initially, even if cache is not empty and located in offheap.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Local MX Bean returns correct value.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13104247">IGNITE-6483</key>
            <summary>Entries count in caches&apos; MX Beans not immediately available</summary>
