                            <comment id="16176230" author="ilyak" created="Fri, 22 Sep 2017 10:17:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reproducer test&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16189596" author="ilyak" created="Tue, 3 Oct 2017 11:52:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It turns out statistics should be enabled for relevant cache and hardbeat should be waited for.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This makes MX beans unusable for anything other than steady-state monitoring. I will create tests for that behavior.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16191016" author="ilyak" created="Wed, 4 Oct 2017 09:10:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It turns out size and keySize are not handled correctly - for cacheMetrics they are taken from local node that doesn&apos;t contain the correct amount.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
